{"4977210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stop The Fire: Apprentice Water Wizard", "steam_appid": 4977210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your very first day as an Apprentice Water Wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you even have time to settle in, a mysterious wildfire erupts across the world. Every experienced wizard has already been dispatched, leaving only one person behind...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your wand and spellbook, extinguish the spreading flames, and uncover the truth behind the disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay: Extinguish Every Fire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put out every fire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From burning forests and blazing houses to smoldering streets, the flames have spread farther than anyone imagined. Rescue innocent townsfolk, save frightened woodland creatures, and restore the world one spell at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere behind the catastrophe, an unseen force is pulling the strings. As the fire fades, so will the mystery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/ae8f3caa652d3be1cd8aa9c2e81b4ba2.poster.avif?t=1787192716\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/ae8f3caa652d3be1cd8aa9c2e81b4ba2.webm?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/ae8f3caa652d3be1cd8aa9c2e81b4ba2.mp4?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn New Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience firefighting through <strong>first-person spellcasting</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim at the flames and cast powerful spells to extinguish the fire. As you restore the world, you'll earn <strong>Skill Points</strong> that can be used to unlock new abilities and expand your magical arsenal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master abilities such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rainfall Spells</strong> to extinguish large areas at once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wind Magic</strong> to reach difficult locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Combo Spells</strong> with unique effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, combine, and master an ever-growing collection of spells to extinguish the impossible.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/255358dfd01990f9b79cb23520551859.poster.avif?t=1787192716\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/255358dfd01990f9b79cb23520551859.webm?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/255358dfd01990f9b79cb23520551859.mp4?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore a Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area you save comes back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burned landscapes gradually recover, special environmental animations appear, and the soundtrack evolves as the world heals. Friendly forest spirits may even join your firefighting efforts, rewarding your progress with delightful surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's always something new waiting to be restored.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/c3249736165395e59101cf8b3efdd03e.poster.avif?t=1787192716\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/c3249736165395e59101cf8b3efdd03e.webm?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/c3249736165395e59101cf8b3efdd03e.mp4?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you carefully extinguish every flame or rush to unlock the most powerful spells, your journey is yours to shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: <strong>4 to 8 hours</strong>, depending on your playstyle and spell choices.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your very first day as an Apprentice Water Wizard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you even have time to settle in, a mysterious wildfire erupts across the world. Every experienced wizard has already been dispatched, leaving only one person behind...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your wand and spellbook, extinguish the spreading flames, and uncover the truth behind the disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay: Extinguish Every Fire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Put out every fire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From burning forests and blazing houses to smoldering streets, the flames have spread farther than anyone imagined. Rescue innocent townsfolk, save frightened woodland creatures, and restore the world one spell at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere behind the catastrophe, an unseen force is pulling the strings. As the fire fades, so will the mystery.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/ae8f3caa652d3be1cd8aa9c2e81b4ba2.poster.avif?t=1787192716\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/ae8f3caa652d3be1cd8aa9c2e81b4ba2.webm?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/ae8f3caa652d3be1cd8aa9c2e81b4ba2.mp4?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn New Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience firefighting through <strong>first-person spellcasting</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim at the flames and cast powerful spells to extinguish the fire. As you restore the world, you'll earn <strong>Skill Points</strong> that can be used to unlock new abilities and expand your magical arsenal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master abilities such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rainfall Spells</strong> to extinguish large areas at once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wind Magic</strong> to reach difficult locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Combo Spells</strong> with unique effects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover, combine, and master an ever-growing collection of spells to extinguish the impossible.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/255358dfd01990f9b79cb23520551859.poster.avif?t=1787192716\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/255358dfd01990f9b79cb23520551859.webm?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/255358dfd01990f9b79cb23520551859.mp4?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore a Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area you save comes back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burned landscapes gradually recover, special environmental animations appear, and the soundtrack evolves as the world heals. Friendly forest spirits may even join your firefighting efforts, rewarding your progress with delightful surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's always something new waiting to be restored.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/c3249736165395e59101cf8b3efdd03e.poster.avif?t=1787192716\" width=640 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/c3249736165395e59101cf8b3efdd03e.webm?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977210/extras/c3249736165395e59101cf8b3efdd03e.mp4?t=1787192716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Your Way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you carefully extinguish every flame or rush to unlock the most powerful spells, your journey is yours to shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: <strong>4 to 8 hours</strong>, depending on your playstyle and spell choices.</p>", "short_description": "Everything is on fire. Learn water magic and restore a world consumed by flames... all on your own.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Turkish, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item